Triggered by: app/admin/reviews/page.tsx — manager clicks 'Approve'
Payload: { reviewGalleryId, cafeId }

The webhook calls PATCH /api/v1/review-gallery/:id { moderationStatus: 'approved' }
Then Express fires POST to this n8n webhook URL.

Returns the full ReviewGallery document joined with its Cafe:
{
  id, cafeId, imageUrl, qrCodeUrl, reviewText, rating, userConsentGranted,
  cafe: { name, city, country, packageType, isArtisticQrPaid, logoAccentColor,
          fbPageId, fbAccessToken, igUserId, tiktokAccessToken, snapAccessToken }
}

ADD THIS ROUTE to Express: GET /api/v1/review-gallery/:id/full
  → prisma.reviewGallery.findUnique({ where: { id }, include: { cafe: true } })

